Sisanya dikemas dan dibawa

108
00:02:43,366 --> 00:02:44,600
Semua orang cepat istirahat

109
00:02:44,666 --> 00:02:45,600
Berangkat saat fajar

110
00:02:59,633 --> 00:03:01,233
Perhatikan baik-baik, waspadai tempat gelap

111
00:03:02,100 --> 00:03:02,533
Mengerti

112
00:03:02,566 --> 00:03:03,466
Kita berkeliling sekali lagi

113
00:03:11,133 --> 00:03:12,766
Tembak terus, ganggu mereka

114
00:03:12,833 --> 00:03:14,033
Biar mereka kehabisan tenaga

115
00:03:14,966 --> 00:03:16,400
Jenderal, mereka mau menyerbu kota lagi!

116
00:03:17,166 --> 00:03:18,200
Siapkan granat tangan

117
00:03:18,233 --> 00:03:19,433
Lempar setelah mereka mendekat

118
00:03:22,633 --> 00:03:23,000
Mundur!

119
00:03:23,033 --> 00:03:24,633
Serang lagi setelah istirahat sebentar

120
00:03:25,433 --> 00:03:26,466
Mereka mundur lagi

121
00:03:26,500 --> 00:03:27,666
Sepanjang malam ini bolak-balik terus

122
00:03:27,766 --> 00:03:28,600
Benar-benar tidak tahan lagi

123
00:03:28,866 --> 00:03:29,366
Bertahanlah!

124
00:03:29,933 --> 00:03:31,166
Semakin mereka maju mundur

125
00:03:31,233 --> 00:03:32,133
