133
00:03:42,466 --> 00:03:42,833
Baik

134
00:03:42,866 --> 00:03:43,266
Pergilah

135
00:03:43,300 --> 00:03:43,933
Periksa dengan teliti

136
00:03:43,966 --> 00:03:44,600
Jangan lengah!

137
00:03:47,666 --> 00:03:49,366
Tentara Perbatasan Barat meski membawa Pasukan Poxi

138
00:03:49,466 --> 00:03:51,033
