Pasukan pemanah berkuda, ikuti aku!

159
00:04:44,733 --> 00:04:45,100
Berhenti!

160
00:04:46,566 --> 00:04:47,000
Lepaskan!

161
00:04:53,300 --> 00:04:54,066
Mundur!

162
00:04:56,900 --> 00:04:57,666
Kejar!

163
00:05:02,733 --> 00:05:03,900
Ini yang kunanti!

164
00:05:04,100 --> 00:05:04,533
Mundur!

165
00:05:04,566 --> 00:05:05,333
Jangan berhenti!

166
00:05:05,366 --> 00:05:07,100
Jangan terlibat dengan pasukan berkuda mereka

167
00:05:24,566 --> 00:05:26,200
Sebelum tujuan utama tercapai

168
00:05:26,500 --> 00:05:27,766
