Tidak pernah bertempur sepuas ini!

485
00:24:48,666 --> 00:24:49,566
Penekanan jarak jauh

486
00:24:49,800 --> 00:24:50,533
Cakupan tembakan

487
00:24:50,866 --> 00:24:51,766
Setiap tahapannya

488
00:24:51,800 --> 00:24:52,833
terhubung dengan sempurna

489
00:24:53,000 --> 00:24:54,166
Aku benar-benar jenius

490
00:24:55,300 --> 00:24:57,766
Prajurit, Kabupaten Longcheng ada tepat di depan kalian

491
00:24:57,900 --> 00:24:58,666
Lewati tanah ini

492
00:24:58,700 --> 00:24:59,833
Pertempuran ini akan segera berakhir

493
00:24:59,866 --> 00:25:00,866
Maju, para pejuang!

494
00:25:00,900 --> 00:25:02,433
Hancurkan mereka, pasukan kavaleri maju!

495
00:25:04,433 --> 00:25:05,433
Infanteri ikuti!

496
00:25:08,400 --> 00:25:09,233
Pertahankan gerbang kamp!

497
00:25:09,400 --> 00:25:10,200
Pasukan perisai maju!

498
00:25:10,233 --> 00:25:11,000
Pemanah menyusul!

499
00:25:11,033 --> 00:25:11,800
Siap!

500
00:25:12,333 --> 00:25:13,266
Busur Silang Qinghe tahan mereka!

501
00:25:17,000 --> 00:25:18,133
Artileri, tembak!

502
00:25:27,333 --> 00:25:28,100
Serang!

503
00:25:33,000 --> 00:25:34,533
Mundur ke dalam!

504
00:25:36,433 --> 00:25:37,200
Lanjutkan!

505
00:25:39,600 --> 00:25:40,966
Menyebar dan cari perlindungan!

506
00:25:46,466 --> 00:25:48,233
Aduh!

507
00:25:50,833 --> 00:25:51,600
Ah!

508
00:25:54,966 --> 00:25:55,766
Sialan!

509
00:25:55,900 --> 00:25:57,600
Aku baru merasa jadi ahli strategi perang

510
00:25:57,633 --> 00:25:59,200
eh kamu malah bikin aku kalah telak!

511
00:25:59,833 --> 00:26:00,866
Mundur, mundur!

512
00:26:00,900 --> 00:26:02,400
Mundur ke luar jangkauan Pelontar Poxi!

513
00:26:04,366 --> 00:26:05,133
Tarik mundur!

514
00:26:08,733 --> 00:26:10,333
Serangan langsung kerugiannya terlalu besar

515
00:26:10,600 --> 00:26:11,566
Memutar jalan terlalu lambat

516
00:26:12,100 --> 00:26:14,266
Mundur pun aku tidak rela

517
00:26:27,533 --> 00:26:28,366
Astaga!

518
00:26:30,900 --> 00:26:32,066
Tuan Besar Ma, Tuan Besar Ma!

519
00:26:33,833 --> 00:26:35,733
Kota Longcheng telah ditembus oleh Orang Perbatasan Barat!

520
00:26:37,500 --> 00:26:38,333
Apa katamu?!

521
00:26:38,866 --> 00:26:40,233
Bagaimana mungkin Kabupaten Longcheng bisa direbut?

522
00:26:40,366 --> 00:26:41,733
Bukankah Xie Changfeng sudah pergi membawa pasukan?

523
00:26:41,766 --> 00:26:43,000
Pasukan Tuan Xie sudah maju

524
00:26:43,033 --> 00:26:44,000
Tapi mereka mendapat hambatan

525
00:26:44,033 --> 00:26:45,500
Pelontar Poxi dari Orang Perbatasan Barat menekan mereka

526
00:26:45,533 --> 00:26:46,800
Untuk sementara mereka tidak bisa menerobos masuk

527
00:26:49,566 --> 00:26:50,333
Suamiku

528
00:26:50,966 --> 00:26:51,733
Ada apa?

529
00:26:52,900 --> 00:26:53,833
Kabupaten Longcheng jatuh

530
00:26:53,866 --> 00:26:55,033
Aku harus menyelamatkan mereka

531
00:27:05,833 --> 00:27:07,666
Qinghe dan yang lain juga keluargaku

532
00:27:07,700 --> 00:27:08,400
Di tempatku

533
00:27:08,433 --> 00:27:09,200
Mereka sama sepertimu

534
00:27:09,233 --> 00:27:10,200
Tak satu pun boleh kurang

535
00:27:10,233 --> 00:27:12,033
Baik, aku tahu. Pergilah.

536
00:27:13,633 --> 00:27:14,500
Apakah sangat berbahaya?

537
00:27:17,300 --> 00:27:19,400
Qinghe, jika terjadi sesuatu padaku

538
00:27:19,566 --> 00:27:20,933
jangan hidup sendirian

539
00:27:21,033 --> 00:27:22,500
carilah orang lain yang baik padamu

540
00:27:24,100 --> 00:27:25,266
Pergi saja

541
00:27:25,500 --> 00:27:26,633
Kalian pasti akan baik-baik saja

542
00:27:27,533 --> 00:27:28,300
Ah

543
00:27:31,133 --> 00:27:32,000
Denganmu ada

544
00:27:32,166 --> 00:27:33,900
mana mungkin ada orang lain yang menyayangiku

545
00:27:34,166 --> 00:27:35,733
Aku, Xu Qinghe, seumur hidupku

546
00:27:35,966 --> 00:27:37,366
hanya kau satu-satunya suamiku

547
00:27:37,966 --> 00:27:39,133
Hidup bersama dalam satu selimut

548
00:27:39,166 --> 00:27:40,333
mati bersama dalam satu liang

549
00:27:40,766 --> 00:27:41,933
Panggil Liu Changshun ke sini!

550
00:27:41,966 --> 00:27:43,300
Setelah itu kalian temui aku di mulut desa.

551
00:27:43,333 --> 00:27:44,933
Lalu ke gudang, bawakan aku dua kotak Granat Tangan

552
00:27:44,966 --> 00:27:45,766
dan tiga Busur Silang Qinghe.

553
00:27:45,800 --> 00:27:46,700
Bawa lebih banyak Panah Busur Silang

554
00:27:46,733 --> 00:27:47,500
Siap

555
00:28:02,533 --> 00:28:03,266
Naik ke mobil

556
00:28:08,100 --> 00:28:09,100
Sudah lihat jelas belum?

557
00:28:13,466 --> 00:28:15,233
Sebentar lagi kita serbu Perkemahan Induk Perbatasan Barat.

558
00:28:15,266 --> 00:28:16,733
Kalian lemparkan Granat Tangan keluar dari jendela mobil.

559
00:28:16,766 --> 00:28:17,533
Tembak Busur Silang Qinghe!

560
00:28:17,700 --> 00:28:19,533
Kalau Orang Perbatasan Barat
melawan, tutup jendela mobilnya!

561
00:28:19,600 --> 00:28:21,066
Benda ini kebal terhadap senjata!

562
00:28:24,433 --> 00:28:26,366
Inilah kotak besi besar yang dulu di Desa Qinghe

563
00:28:26,400 --> 00:28:27,433
membuat pasukan seribu orang dari Wilayah Perbatasan Barat

564
00:28:27,466 --> 00:28:29,066
tercerai-berai kacau balau

565
00:28:29,266 --> 00:28:30,033
Kali ini

566
00:28:32,233 --> 00:28:33,466
aku yang duduk di dalamnya

567
00:28:40,566 --> 00:28:41,333
Wah

568
00:28:42,233 --> 00:28:43,100
Tidak ada jalur

569
00:28:44,366 --> 00:28:45,600
Tidak ada lampu lalu lintas

570
00:28:46,333 --> 00:28:47,333
Tidak ada batas kecepatan

571
00:28:47,433 --> 00:28:48,500
Tidak perlu menghindari pejalan kaki

572
00:28:49,033 --> 00:28:50,000
Tepatnya

573
00:28:50,266 --> 00:28:51,433
mereka justru jadi sasaran

574
00:28:53,166 --> 00:28:54,300
Sudah bertahun-tahun jadi sopir

575
00:28:56,733 --> 00:28:57,700
Hahaha

576
00:28:57,933 --> 00:29:00,066
Belum pernah aku mengemudi sepuas ini

577
00:29:04,400 --> 00:29:05,133
Ugh

578
00:29:05,833 --> 00:29:06,300
Hmm

579
00:29:06,700 --> 00:29:08,133
Astaga, Changshun

580
00:29:08,333 --> 00:29:09,333
Kau ini mau bikin aku mual

581
00:29:09,366 --> 00:29:10,466
atau bikin orang Wilayah Perbatasan Barat mual

582
00:29:10,500 --> 00:29:11,566
Cepat bersiap untuk bergerak!

583
00:29:13,100 --> 00:29:13,866
Hah?

584
00:29:24,200 --> 00:29:25,633
I-ini benda apa?!

585
00:29:27,833 --> 00:29:28,966
Serbu masuk ke kota dulu!

586
00:29:29,000 --> 00:29:30,200
Selamatkan sebanyak yang kita bisa!

587
00:29:32,000 --> 00:29:33,233
Kalau ini bukan komandan utama

588
00:29:33,300 --> 00:29:34,833
Aku makan setir mobilnya!

589
00:29:35,333 --> 00:29:37,100
Sekarang, apa gunanya menerobos masuk ke kota?

590
00:29:37,233 --> 00:29:38,400
Kita cuma bertiga.

591
00:29:38,433 --> 00:29:39,433
Bahkan kalau kita berhasil masuk,

592
00:29:39,466 --> 00:29:40,800
itu tetap tidak akan cukup.

593
00:29:41,433 --> 00:29:43,566
Tapi kalau kita habisi orang-orang di bawah panji itu

594
00:29:44,133 --> 00:29:45,300
Tangkap dulu pemimpinnya

595
00:29:49,033 --> 00:29:50,400
Terjang saja!

596
00:29:52,333 --> 00:29:53,100
Ma Zhenbang!

597
00:29:53,700 --> 00:29:55,766
Kamu pakai semua bensinnya untuk dirimu sendiri!

598
00:29:55,966 --> 00:29:57,400
Terakhir kali kamu tidak membiarkan aku mengemudinya!

599
00:29:57,766 --> 00:29:58,766
Kali ini kau, si tampan ini

600
00:29:58,800 --> 00:29:59,966
membawa mobilnya keluar lagi

